        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-07T03:05:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the problem is we need to pass handler to ResultReceiver. I have consider to rework this part in the future. Maybe in R ? But the handler is still needed for current design.",
      "parentUuid": "2d0c3bdd_ba56145b",
      "revId": "b448ca74df46363539567c556980b12d7740b9eb",
