    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7117ce0f_9383ba5d",
        "filename": "core/java/android/net/ConnectivityManager.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 2748,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-07T03:05:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The change is base on the the suggestion of API review b/126701557\n\nWarning M3: Listeners should always be at end of argument list\n    in method @RequiresPermission(android.Manifest.permission.TETHER_PRIVILEGED) public void getLatestTetheringEntitlementValue(int, boolean, @NonNull android.net.ConnectivityManager.TetheringEntitlementValueListener, @Nullable android.os.Handler)\n    in public class ConnectivityManager\n    in package android.net\n    at line 4028\n    last modified by markchien@google.com in f27312788000",
      "parentUuid": "a1d09f3b_b5091776",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2748,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2748,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "b448ca74df46363539567c556980b12d7740b9eb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f6332abe_067f75c9",
        "filename": "core/java/android/net/ConnectivityManager.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 2748,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-07T04:21:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What ?\n\nThis is absolutely trivial to fix. The only place where the handler is used is right here in line 2751. ResultReceiver is happy to take a null handler you know, and then it runs onReceiveResult on the current thread.\n\n  public void getLatestTetheringEntitlementResult(int type, boolean showEntitlementUi,\n          @NonNull Executor executor,\n          @NonNull final OnTetheringEntitlementResultListener listener) {\n      Preconditions.checkNotNull(listener, \"TetheringEntitlementResultListener cannot be null.\");\n      ResultReceiver wrappedListener \u003d new ResultReceiver(null) {\n          @Override\n          protected void onReceiveResult(int resultCode, Bundle resultData) {\n              executor.execute(() -\u003e listener.onEntitlementResult(resultCode));\n          }\n      };\n      ...",
      "parentUuid": "33e757f7_e4422014",
      "revId": "b448ca74df46363539567c556980b12d7740b9eb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "215ea6a6_079b5e58",
        "filename": "core/java/android/net/ConnectivityManager.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 2748,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-07T04:21:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As Mark points out, it\u0027s standard for listeners (and generally SAM types) to be put last.\n\nThe reason is you frequently want to write the listener as a lambda, but thinking about the code you want to put in the lambda is best done after everything else has been written, so you typically prefer to have the lambda at the end.\nIt\u0027s more visible in languages supporting lambdas as a first-class citizen. Consider :\n\n  public void addOnClickListener(OnClickListener listener, Handler handler);\n\nThe Kotlin calls look like :\n\n  addOnClickListener({ view -\u003e\n      validateForm()\n      stuffToDo.forEach { stuff -\u003e stuff.do() }\n  }, handler);\n\nNow consider :\n\n  public void onClick(OnClickListener listener, Handler handler);\n\nThe Kotlin call looks like :\n\n  onClick(handler) { view -\u003e\n      validateForm()\n      stuffToDo.forEach { stuff -\u003e stuff.do() }\n  }\n\n...the latter is much nicer. And because Java does not have named arguments, putting the SAM last is the only way to get this benefit.",
      "parentUuid": "7117ce0f_9383ba5d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2748,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2748,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "b448ca74df46363539567c556980b12d7740b9eb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
